-- src:2506 | particular,
@ref s 42(3) (guilt) (src:2500-2506)
GIVEN `the person fails to comply with a notice under the section` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person in purported compliance knowingly or recklessly makes a statement false in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 42(3) the person is guilty of an offence` MEANS `the person fails to comply with a notice under the section` OR `the person in purported compliance knowingly or recklessly makes a statement false in a material particular`

-- src:2508 | shall be guilty of an offence and shall be liable on conviction to a fine
